Detection content
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Sigma rules in defense/telemetry/sigma/ and the YARA rules in
defense/telemetry/yara/ are additionally offered under the
Detection Rule License 1.1 (DRL-1.1), https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License,
so they can be adopted and redistributed by detection-engineering projects that
standardise on it.

