What this project deliberately does not contain
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - No bypass, crack, loader, or circumvention code, in source or binary form.
  - No game files, installers, disc images, or any part of a pirated release.
  - No download links, mirrors, magnet links, or instructions for obtaining any
    of the above.

Components of the analyzed bypass are referenced by file name and SHA-256 only,
and only where doing so serves detection. See CLAUDE.md for the operating rules
this project held itself to.
